<img src="img/michinoku2_022_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td><a href="#7">
<img src="img/michinoku2_026_small.jpg" width="146" /></a></td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>
			&nbsp;</td>
